+/*
+ * [Bluesky] Text layouts made off the main thread, so that a text view's first
+ * draw doesn't lay its text out again on the main thread.
+ *
+ * - Measuring keeps its laid-out text storage ("measured layouts").
+ * - After layout, ParagraphShadowNode asks for the text of every text view
